---
config:
  theme: mc
  look: classic
---
sequenceDiagram
    title User Updates Profile / Changes Password (System Architecture Flow)
    actor User
    participant ProfileController.cs
    participant AccountProxyService.cs
    participant IAccountService as BoardRentAndProperty.ApiClient: IAccountService
    participant AccountService as API: AccountService
    participant AccountRepository as API: AccountRepository
    participant SQLDatabase as SQL Database
    activate ProfileController.cs
    activate AccountProxyService.cs
    Note over AccountProxyService.cs: Maps data to unified contract<br/>AccountProfileDataTransferObject
    activate IAccountService
    IAccountService->>AccountService: HTTP PUT /api/accounts/{id} (or /change-password)
    activate AccountService
    Note over AccountService: Validation Logic<br/>(Checks phone/email formats & password hashes)
    AccountService->>AccountRepository: UpdateAsync(account) / UpdatePasswordAsync(id, hash)
    activate AccountRepository
    AccountRepository->>SQLDatabase: UPDATE Accounts SET DisplayName, Email, Phone, Address (SaveChanges)
    SQLDatabase-->>AccountRepository: updated Account record
    AccountRepository-->>AccountService: Task Completed
    deactivate AccountRepository
    AccountService-->>IAccountService: HTTP 200 OK (Success DTO)
    deactivate AccountService
    deactivate IAccountService
    Note over AccountProxyService.cs: If (!result.Success)<br/>throw ProxyServiceException()
    deactivate AccountProxyService.cs
    Note over ProfileController.cs: TempData["SuccessMessage"] =<br/>"Profile updated successfully."
    deactivate ProfileController.cs
